<p><strong>5267-breach-4 Audio log</strong></p>
<p><em>Audio log entry- dr. brooks, date(𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐉𶐿𶐉)<br />
There had been a breach, a boar dependent to the compound had grown into 6 meters in length, which climbed across the walls with its mutated limbs and went inside the tunnel Todd and his colleagues made all those years ago, and was running upwards to the cave’s entrance, personnel above are trying to hold a barrier to stop the boar, in such short notice that the staff knew that they were not enough, but they held their ground knowing the price incompetence would have to pay.<br />
I, Dr. Brooks, agent Ross, agent Oliver, Dr. Dravis, and Dr. Todd went to a high-pressure elevator that goes to the speed of a hundred meters per second, once at the desired level we went towards the buggies dr. Todd developed in case of a breach, we ran towards a buggy agent Oliver drove whilst I and agent Ross handled two machine guns on the buggy, as we went pursuit we shot the boar’s legs again and again but the boar never flinched on such firearms, moments later Drs. Dravis and Todd followed pursuit Dravis radioed that the hide of the boar was too thick to shoot, he told us to get some grenades at the storage box on our seats, we took some grenades and threw them at the boar Oliver got one lucky shot as the grenade exploded at the boar’s chest, and we saw the boar’s exposed ribcage, the boar stopped, turned around and ran towards us it was about forty feet from us, just before Todd and Dravis used automatic grenade launchers to shoot the 6 meter boar till the boar was nothing more than charred meat lying on the ground, but knowing that the boar might still regenerate Todd attached a flame thrower to his buggy and started to set the boar on fire again until the bones were black in color, and would crumble when Dravis stepped on its skull, when that was done Todd told Ross and Oliver to smash the remaining pieces of charred bone, they did as they were told, after that I reported to the men above via radio that the threat was now neutralized and ordered a group alongside Oliver to follow the cleanup procedure Dravis formed a few weeks ago and to rebuild the metal gate which the boar smashed through<br />
