<p><strong>incident-report-5267-6</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Incident report-Dr. Chase-Date(redacted)</strong><br />
The team and I were talking about changing the cavity’s status to an EX, Dravis and his associates changed their minds when Derrick and Brooks told them that the foundation was not all-knowing neither all benevolent</p>
<p>indeed we had enemies, GOC, Chaos Insurgency, Serpent's Hand, and more,</p>
<p>we ended up agreeing that compound B315-L should not be made known ever by any means,</p>
<p>I, Edward, and two kilo-tango-22 operatives namely Oliver and Daniel went out to catalog native animals in the northwest side of Prime when the incident occurred,<br />
the wall on our right burst open, dust rocks and debris were flying around the place, Oliver immediately called backup, and Daniel shot out an electric net,<br />
but before he could set his gun, three arrows flanged through his chest, with a loud grunt he knelt, out came from the dust of clouds a cry of anger echoed around us followed by three armed hairy figures riding on horseback, but instead of horses they rode on biped reptilian creatures similar to fossil-creatures specifically Mesozoic, we watched in horror as Oliver turned his gun to 6000-Voltz and shot out short bursts at the attackers a hundred feet away,<br />
Edward quickly took an electric handgun at his side, the foundation developed a few months ago, and began shooting the three figures, Oliver successfully shot down a rider and its dino, Edward shot another dino down, the rider jumped off and ran towards us, I then shot the rider with my gun down, Oliver aimed at the third dino and shot, but at the same time the rider jumped a few feet in the air and threw a menacing spear with such strength that it went through Oliver with such speed that the spear landed a few feet behind Oliver with this the attacker produced a blade from his side just before, ZAPP, Daniel stood and shot down the figure that it hardened and fell, unconscious,<br />
Daniel reported to his radio saying that the threat had been counteracted and that we needed a truck and a few more men for backup, he finished and pulled out the three arrows in his chest, with a loud grunt his wounds healed, with that we helped Oliver stand and when he stood I saw his cells working to heal his chest in action a few seconds later his injury healed,<br />
we stood and as the dust cleared we saw another cavity, we tied down the creatures and I and Edward confirmed that the creatures up close were affected by the compound, we tied them up, afterward, we looked at the interior of the cavity, there were no more instances of additional hostiles, and as we looked there were no more additional instances to take care of, the cavity was almost like that of Prime but with differences,<br />
among such were that the cavity was far larger than prime, down the slope we saw were multiple instances of lakes, rivers, forests, and in the distance were multiple huts that looked like a native village in Africa, next we noticed before backup came were instances of B’s, with multiple hues of orange, yellow, red, and as we looked closer instances of blue, and white.<br />
Backup came and they brought the instances on the truckload I told them to install a campsite with personnel, the location would be camped by guards, a few weeks-time I will construct a facility between the two cavities, to better learn of the additional cavity which will be named SCP-ECHO, the instances earlier were confirmed to be instances of SCP 1000 riding what I confirm to be instances of Utahraptor ostrommaysi, which were the only known member of the family Utahraptor ostrommaysi, which is the largest known member of the family Dromaeosauridae in the Mesozoic era, both instances of which are dependent on the compound; the Utahraptors are to be transferred to site-96 and the dependent instances of 1000 would stay in Prime’s facility for a momentary examination, <strong>the foundation was always cold and heartless, but never cruel</strong><br />
<strong>End report</strong></p>
